{"about_the_game":"Game only available in french<br><br><br><i><strong>Data Rush : La course aux donn\u00e9es</strong></i> is a unique educational video game set in the world of digital data. Take control of a customizable avatar and race through crazy 2D levels with a singular art direction. Learn more about the world of DATA through memorable encounters with colorful characters, dynamic mini-games and offbeat puzzles. <br><br>In <i><strong>Data Rush: La course aux donn\u00e9es</strong></i>, you'll experience an adventure mixing mystery and humor in the heart of digital spaces, in the company of your sidekick Clic. Set off in search of your lost data and foil the plans of the Machiavellian Dr. Frankenclic!<br><br>The game alternates between exploration phases in 2D levels designed and animated entirely by hand, interactions with NPCs, as well as enigmatic phases, games to test your knowledge and puzzles. But there's more to come...","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tu t\u2019es fait arnaquer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/5e377bccc39ef721d8ed816a897a1b41be24efbb.jpg"},{"name":"En route vers l\u2019aventure\u00a0!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/98f66ea2ac8a8ba569be5b22e05b6a4510ed31ac.jpg"},{"name":"L\u2019Autoroute des donn\u00e9es","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/928e8d98a9d1085aa438799f00e633ce544e0de3.jpg"},{"name":"Centre de stockage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/1b0e718e0d1ef1f444dde406431613b49627bd5b.jpg"},{"name":"La cour des I.A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/3524502ab5be0efa1f3790eddd3605c6bb30f612.jpg"},{"name":"La publicit\u00e9 Monstrueuse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740780/ec2c3aa7f95c02b7569ca7c933daf07d9ff1c78a.jpg"},{"name